{{!
    @template enrol_apply/review_outcome

    "On confirming": what an approval does, stated as a sentence, with the adjustments folded
    under it, and one disclosure for the message to the applicant and the note for the record.
    Rendered for a reader who may decide, inside the review form.

    The sentence, the line after it and the empty-choice line name the groups the approval really
    joins, read from the helpers the approval runs; with no group ticked that is the method's
    default, which for an application a group key sent for review includes the key's group, so
    unticking every box is never "no group" and the line under the cards says what it is. They
    arrive ESCAPED from the renderer, which builds them from escaped names, and are triple
    stashed; enrol_apply/review rewrites them with textContent when a tick or the role changes,
    from the plain names in the data attributes.

    The cards are real checkboxes named groups[], and "Add another group" is a plain multiple
    select named groups[] that core's autocomplete enhances above the threshold; without
    JavaScript it is a native multi-select and both post together, allowlisted as before. Its
    wrapper carries data-fieldtype autocomplete so Behat drives it as core's control. The
    grouping filter needs the script, so it is hidden until the script shows it.

    Disclosures are native details elements, open in the server's markup when they must be.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * outcomeheading string - the card's heading
    * outcomesentence string - who joins which groups with which role, ESCAPED, triple stashed
    * hasoutcomeafter boolean, outcomeafter string - the counts after the decision, ESCAPED
    * outcomenotkey boolean - whether the approval leaves out the key's group as the page loads
    * outcomenotkeytext string - the sentence saying so, ESCAPED
    * outcomereadonly boolean, outcomereadonlyhelp string - for a decider who may not choose
    * outcomewho string - the applicant's name, plain, for the script
    * outcomekeygroup int - the key's group when the reader may see it, 0 otherwise
    * outcomedefaultids string - the default groups' ids, comma separated
    * outcomedefaulthidden int - how many default groups the reader may not see
    * outcomedefaultnames array - the visible default groups, each with name (plain)
    * outcomekepthidden int - how many of the method's groups kept outside this reader's choice they may not see
    * outcomekeptnames array - the visible ones, each with name (plain)
    * haskept boolean, keptgroups string - the line saying they stay, ESCAPED
    * outcomedefaultrole string - the method's role, ESCAPED, triple stashed into a hidden span
      the script reads as text
    * outcomeplaces int, outcomeplacestaken int - the method's places and how many are taken
    * hasadjust boolean - whether this decider may choose groups or a role
    * adjustopen boolean - whether "Adjust" opens as the page loads
    * adjustlabel string - its summary
    * hasgroupchooser boolean, groupchooserlabel string - the cards' fieldset and its legend
    * haspinnedhelp boolean, pinnedhelp string - the hint above pinned cards, above the threshold
    * hasgroupcards boolean, groupcards array - one card per group, each with id, name (plain),
      checked, iskey, keybadge, ismethod, methodbadge, hasseats, members, seats, percent,
      barclass, barlabel and seatstext
    * hasaddgroups boolean - whether the other groups are searched
    * addgrouplabel, addgroupcount, addgrouphelp string - the search's label, count and hint
    * addgroups array - one option per other group, each with id, text, name, hasseats, members,
      seats and groupings (comma delimited grouping ids)
    * hasgroupings boolean, groupinglabel, groupingall string, groupings array (id, name plain)
    * emptychoice string - what an approval with no group ticked joins, ESCAPED
    * hasrolechooser boolean, rolelabel, rolehelp string, roledefaultoption string (ESCAPED, it
      names the method's role), roles array - id and name pairs, the name ESCAPED, as core's
      element-select.mustache has it
    * writeopen boolean - whether the message disclosure opens, which it does whenever either box
      holds a value (the way back from the cancel confirmation)
    * writelabel string, writehelp string - the disclosure's summary and hint
    * messagelabel, messagehelp, messagevalue string - the message to the applicant
    * notelabel, notehelp, notevalue string - the decider's note. notevalue is NOT the note
      already stored, which the strip shows: the writer clears on empty, so a pre-filled box would
      carry one decision's reason silently into the next

    Example context (json):
    {
        "outcomeheading": "On confirming",
        "outcomesentence": "Ana Souza joins the course as Student and the group R&amp;D &lt; Team, and is notified of the approval.",
        "hasoutcomeafter": true,
        "outcomeafter": "Afterwards: R&amp;D &lt; Team with 19 of 20 seats taken.",
        "outcomenotkey": false,
        "outcomenotkeytext": "Does not join R&amp;D &lt; Team, the key's group.",
        "outcomewho": "Ana Souza",
        "outcomekeygroup": 3,
        "outcomedefaultids": "3",
        "outcomedefaulthidden": 0,
        "outcomedefaultnames": [{"name": "R&D < Team"}],
        "outcomekepthidden": 0,
        "outcomekeptnames": [],
        "haskept": false,
        "keptgroups": "",
        "outcomedefaultrole": "Student",
        "outcomeplaces": 0,
        "outcomeplacestaken": 0,
        "hasadjust": true,
        "adjustopen": false,
        "adjustlabel": "Adjust groups and role",
        "hasgroupchooser": true,
        "groupchooserlabel": "Groups to join on approval",
        "haspinnedhelp": true,
        "pinnedhelp": "Ticked: the groups this approval uses by default.",
        "hasgroupcards": true,
        "groupcards": [
            {
                "id": 3, "name": "R&D < Team", "checked": true, "iskey": true, "keybadge": "Key group",
                "hasseats": true, "members": 18, "seats": 20, "percent": 90, "barclass": "bg-warning text-dark",
                "barlabel": "R&D < Team: 18 of 20 seats taken", "seatstext": "18 of 20 seats taken, 2 left"
            }
        ],
        "hasaddgroups": true,
        "addgrouplabel": "Add another group",
        "addgroupcount": "12 groups to choose from",
        "addgrouphelp": "Type part of the group's name or code.",
        "addgroups": [
            {"id": 4, "text": "Turma 8 · 15 of 20 seats", "name": "Turma 8", "hasseats": true, "members": 15, "seats": 20, "groupings": ",1,"}
        ],
        "hasgroupings": true,
        "groupinglabel": "Grouping",
        "groupingall": "All groupings",
        "groupings": [{"id": 1, "name": "Evening"}],
        "emptychoice": "With no group ticked, the approval uses the default groups: R&amp;D &lt; Team.",
        "hasrolechooser": true,
        "rolelabel": "Role to assign on approval",
        "rolehelp": "Leave it alone to use the role configured on the enrolment method.",
        "roledefaultoption": "Use the role set on the enrolment method (Student)",
        "roles": [{"id": 5, "name": "Student"}],
        "writeopen": false,
        "writelabel": "Write to the applicant or add a note for the record",
        "writehelp": "Optional.",
        "messagelabel": "Message to the applicant",
        "messagehelp": "Included in the message they receive.",
        "messagevalue": "",
        "notelabel": "Note for the record",
        "notehelp": "The applicant never sees it.",
        "notevalue": ""
    }
}}
<section class="enrol_apply-outcome card mb-3" aria-labelledby="enrol_apply_outcome_heading" data-region="enrol_apply-outcome"
    data-who="{{outcomewho}}" data-keygroup="{{outcomekeygroup}}" data-defaultids="{{outcomedefaultids}}"
    data-defaulthidden="{{outcomedefaulthidden}}" data-kepthidden="{{outcomekepthidden}}" data-places="{{outcomeplaces}}" data-placestaken="{{outcomeplacestaken}}">
    <div class="card-body">
        <h2 class="h5" id="enrol_apply_outcome_heading">{{outcomeheading}}</h2>
        <p class="mb-1" data-region="outcome-sentence">{{{outcomesentence}}}</p>
        <p class="small mb-1" data-region="outcome-notkey"{{^outcomenotkey}} hidden{{/outcomenotkey}}>{{{outcomenotkeytext}}}</p>
        <p class="small text-body-secondary mb-0" data-region="outcome-after"{{^hasoutcomeafter}} hidden{{/hasoutcomeafter}}>{{{outcomeafter}}}</p>
        {{#outcomereadonly}}<p class="form-text mb-0">{{outcomereadonlyhelp}}</p>{{/outcomereadonly}}
        <span data-region="outcome-defaultrole" hidden>{{{outcomedefaultrole}}}</span>
        <ul data-region="outcome-defaults" hidden>
            {{#outcomedefaultnames}}<li>{{name}}</li>{{/outcomedefaultnames}}
        </ul>
        <ul data-region="outcome-kept" hidden>
            {{#outcomekeptnames}}<li>{{name}}</li>{{/outcomekeptnames}}
        </ul>
        {{#hasadjust}}
            <details class="enrol_apply-adjust mt-3" id="enrol_apply_adjust"{{#adjustopen}} open{{/adjustopen}}>
                <summary>{{adjustlabel}}</summary>
                {{#hasgroupchooser}}
                    <fieldset class="enrol_apply-groupchooser mt-2">
                        <legend class="fs-6 fw-semibold">{{groupchooserlabel}}</legend>
                        {{#haspinnedhelp}}<p class="form-text mt-0">{{pinnedhelp}}</p>{{/haspinnedhelp}}
                        {{#hasgroupcards}}
                            <div class="enrol_apply-groupcards">
                                {{#groupcards}}
                                    <div class="enrol_apply-groupcard">
                                        <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="enrol_apply_group_{{id}}" name="groups[]"
                                            value="{{id}}" data-name="{{name}}" data-hasseats="{{#hasseats}}1{{/hasseats}}{{^hasseats}}0{{/hasseats}}"
                                            data-members="{{members}}" data-seats="{{seats}}" aria-describedby="enrol_apply_group_{{id}}_seats"{{#checked}} checked{{/checked}}>
                                        <div class="enrol_apply-groupcardbody">
                                            <div class="enrol_apply-groupcardhead">
                                                <label class="enrol_apply-groupcardname" for="enrol_apply_group_{{id}}">{{name}}{{#iskey}} <span class="badge bg-primary text-white">{{keybadge}}</span>{{/iskey}}{{#ismethod}} <span class="badge bg-secondary text-dark">{{methodbadge}}</span>{{/ismethod}}</label>
                                                {{#hasseats}}<span class="small">{{percent}}%</span>{{/hasseats}}
                                            </div>
                                            {{#hasseats}}
                                                <div class="progress enrol_apply-groupbar" role="progressbar" aria-label="{{barlabel}}"
                                                    aria-valuenow="{{members}}" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="{{seats}}">
                                                    <div class="progress-bar {{barclass}}" style="width: {{percent}}%"></div>
                                                </div>
                                            {{/hasseats}}
                                            <span class="small text-body-secondary" id="enrol_apply_group_{{id}}_seats">{{seatstext}}</span>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                {{/groupcards}}
                            </div>
                        {{/hasgroupcards}}
                        {{#hasaddgroups}}
                            <div class="enrol_apply-addgroups mt-3">
                                {{#hasgroupings}}
                                    <div class="enrol_apply-groupingfilter mb-2" data-region="groupingfilter" hidden>
                                        <label class="form-label" for="enrol_apply_grouping">{{groupinglabel}}</label>
                                        <select class="form-select" id="enrol_apply_grouping" data-region="groupingselect">
                                            <option value="0">{{groupingall}}</option>
                                            {{#groupings}}<option value="{{id}}">{{name}}</option>{{/groupings}}
                                        </select>
                                    </div>
                                {{/hasgroupings}}
                                <label class="form-label" for="enrol_apply_addgroups">{{addgrouplabel}}</label>
                                <span class="small text-body-secondary ms-2">{{addgroupcount}}</span>
                                <div data-fieldtype="autocomplete">
                                    <select class="form-select" id="enrol_apply_addgroups" name="groups[]" multiple
                                        aria-describedby="enrol_apply_addgroups_help">
                                        {{#addgroups}}
                                            <option value="{{id}}" data-name="{{name}}" data-hasseats="{{#hasseats}}1{{/hasseats}}{{^hasseats}}0{{/hasseats}}" data-members="{{members}}" data-seats="{{seats}}" data-groupings="{{groupings}}">{{text}}</option>
                                        {{/addgroups}}
                                    </select>
                                </div>
                                <div class="form-text" id="enrol_apply_addgroups_help">{{addgrouphelp}}</div>
                            </div>
                        {{/hasaddgroups}}
                        {{#haskept}}<p class="form-text mb-1" data-region="outcome-kept-line">{{{keptgroups}}}</p>{{/haskept}}
                        <p class="form-text mb-0" data-region="outcome-emptychoice">{{{emptychoice}}}</p>
                    </fieldset>
                {{/hasgroupchooser}}
                {{#hasrolechooser}}
                    <div class="enrol_apply-decisionrole mt-3">
                        <label class="form-label" for="enrol_apply_roleid">{{rolelabel}}</label>
                        <select class="form-select" id="enrol_apply_roleid" name="roleid"
                            aria-describedby="enrol_apply_roleid_help">
                            <option value="0">{{{roledefaultoption}}}</option>
                            {{#roles}}
                                <option value="{{id}}">{{{name}}}</option>
                            {{/roles}}
                        </select>
                        <div class="form-text" id="enrol_apply_roleid_help">{{rolehelp}}</div>
                    </div>
                {{/hasrolechooser}}
            </details>
        {{/hasadjust}}
    </div>
</section>
<details class="enrol_apply-write mb-3"{{#writeopen}} open{{/writeopen}}>
    <summary>{{writelabel}}</summary>
    <p class="form-text mt-1 mb-0">{{writehelp}}</p>
    <div class="enrol_apply-outcomemessage mt-2">
        <label class="form-label" for="enrol_apply_outcomemessage">{{messagelabel}}</label>
        <textarea class="form-control" id="enrol_apply_outcomemessage" name="outcomemessage"
            rows="3" aria-describedby="enrol_apply_outcomemessage_help">{{messagevalue}}</textarea>
        <div class="form-text" id="enrol_apply_outcomemessage_help">{{messagehelp}}</div>
    </div>
    <div class="enrol_apply-decisionnote mt-3">
        <label class="form-label" for="enrol_apply_decisionnote">{{notelabel}}</label>
        <textarea class="form-control" id="enrol_apply_decisionnote" name="decisionnote"
            rows="3" aria-describedby="enrol_apply_decisionnote_help">{{notevalue}}</textarea>
        <div class="form-text" id="enrol_apply_decisionnote_help">{{notehelp}}</div>
    </div>
</details>
